---
// Quiet, minimal status pill - fully responsive on narrow mobile
---

<div class="inline-flex max-w-full flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 rounded-full border border-(--border) bg-(--bg-alt) px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-(--fg-dim) shadow-xs transition-colors hover:border-(--border-hover)">
  <span class="flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
  <span class="font-medium text-(--fg)">Open for new opportunities</span>
  <span class="text-(--fg-faint) hidden xs:inline">•</span>
  <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm">Hanoi, Vietnam</span>
</div>
